{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01KqF9mgsqRK14B4Z8cepixs","type":"tool_result","content":"spec:\nREADME.md\nstack.md\ntickets\n\nspec/tickets:\n01-movie-list.md\n02-auditorium-map.md\n03-seat-selection.md\n04-booking-summary.md\n05-checkout.md\n06-confirmation.md\n07-final-pass.md\nREADME.md\n# Stack\n\nThe workspace is an Nx 23 monorepo. The application is the Nx project `cinescope` in\n`apps/cinescope`, generated with the Nx Angular application generator: **Angular 22**,\nstandalone components, zoneless, Angular Router with an empty route list, SCSS, Vitest for\nunit tests and ESLint. **Angular Material 22** and the Angular CDK are installed, a Material\ntheme is applied in `styles.scss`, and the native date adapter is provided for the\ndatepicker. It is ready to run; build the application on top of it.\n32421 spec/README.md","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"f36d358a-b9a0-405d-bd0d-b9be109acf26","uuid":"32b4984f-9160-415d-988c-6e407c8dc326","timestamp":"2026-11-27T13:54:29.817Z","tool_use_result":{"stdout":"spec:\nREADME.md\nstack.md\ntickets\n\nspec/tickets:\n01-movie-list.md\n02-auditorium-map.md\n03-seat-selection.md\n04-booking-summary.md\n05-checkout.md\n06-confirmation.md\n07-final-pass.md\nREADME.md\n# Stack\n\nThe workspace is an Nx 23 monorepo. The application is the Nx project `cinescope` in\n`apps/cinescope`, generated with the Nx Angular application generator: **Angular 22**,\nstandalone components, zoneless, Angular Router with an empty route list, SCSS, Vitest for\nunit tests and ESLint. **Angular Material 22** and the Angular CDK are installed, a Material\ntheme is applied in `styles.scss`, and the native date adapter is provided for the\ndatepicker. It is ready to run; build the application on top of it.\n32421 spec/README.md","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false}}
