{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-haiku-5-5","id":"msg_011ChTd34Pow24QpnW5APRNk","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01LKJWCnuusWQ4FxxRBGJxGD","name":"Bash","input":{"command":"cd /workspace/project/apps/cinescope/src/app && for f in summary/summary.ts summary/summary.html summary/summary.scss; do echo \"==== $f\"; cat \"$f\"; done; ls /workspace/project/apps/cinescope/src/app; cat /workspace/project/spec/tickets/04-booking-summary.md | head -30","description":"Read summary component and ticket 04"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":2,"cache_creation_input_tokens":17002,"cache_read_input_tokens":27775,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":17002,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BkLP1LQtz921G1oMMPTki4","session_id":"f36d358a-b9a0-405d-bd0d-b9be109acf26","uuid":"0df06822-b685-431d-8e56-a4f4f3c7bab6","timestamp":"2026-11-27T14:03:16.997Z","request_id":"req_011ChTd34FNEhWZTrnDcvnWt","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 05"}
{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01LKJWCnuusWQ4FxxRBGJxGD","type":"tool_result","content":"==== summary/summary.ts\nimport { Component, computed, effect, inject, input, resource } from '@angular/core';\nimport { MatButtonModule } from '@angular/material/button';\nimport { Router } from '@angular/router';\nimport { BookedItem, BookingStore, formatPrice, itemKey, priceOf, totalPrice } from '../booking';\nimport { CinemaApi } from '../cinema-api';\nimport { Movie, Screening } from '../models';\n\ninterface SummaryData {\n  movie: Movie;\n  screening: Screening;\n}\n\ninterface SummaryLine {\n  key: string;\n  item: BookedItem;\n  seat: string;\n  price: string;\n}\n\n@Component({\n  selector: 'app-summary',\n  imports: [MatButtonModule],\n  templateUrl: './summary.html',\n  styleUrl: './summary.scss',\n})\nexport class Summary {\n  private readonly api = inject(CinemaApi);\n  private readonly bookings = inject(BookingStore);\n  private readonly router = inject(Router);\n\n  /** Bound from the `id` route parameter. */\n  readonly id = input.required<string>();\n\n  protected readonly data = resource({\n    params: () => this.id(),\n    loader: async ({ params: id }): Promise<SummaryData> => {\n      const screening = await this.api.getScreening(Number(id));\n      const movie = await this.api.getMovie(screening.movieId);\n      return { movie, screening };\n    },\n  });\n\n  protected readonly lines = computed<SummaryLine[]>(() =>\n    (this.bookings.booking()?.items ?? []).map((item) => ({\n      key: itemKey(item),\n      item,\n      seat: item.couch ? `Couch ${item.column}-${item.column + 1}` : `${item.column}`,\n      price: formatPrice(priceOf(item)),\n    })),\n  );\n\n  protected readonly total = computed(\n    () => `Total: ${formatPrice(totalPrice(this.bookings.booking()?.items ?? []))}`,\n  );\n\n  constructor() {\n    effect(() => {\n      if (this.data.error()) {\n        this.router.navigate(['/']);\n      }\n    });\n  }\n\n  /** Takes one seat or couch out of the booking; opens the seat map when none is left. */\n  protected remove(key: string): void {\n    const remaining = (this.bookings.booking()?.items ?? []).filter((item) => itemKey(item) !== key);\n    this.bookings.setItems(remaining);\n    if (remaining.length === 0) {\n      this.toSeats();\n    }\n  }\n\n  protected back(): void {\n    this.toSeats();\n  }\n\n  protected confirm(): void {\n    this.router.navigate(['/screenings', this.id(), 'checkout']);\n  }\n\n  private toSeats(): void {\n    this.router.navigate(['/screenings', this.id(), 'seats']);\n  }\n}\n==== summary/summary.html\n<section class=\"summary\">\n  <h1 data-testid=\"summary-title\">Your tickets</h1>\n\n  @if (data.value(); as loaded) {\n    <ul class=\"summary-list\" data-testid=\"summary-list\">\n      @for (line of lines(); track line.key) {\n        <li class=\"summary-item\" data-testid=\"summary-item\">\n          <span class=\"field\" data-testid=\"summary-item-title\">{{ loaded.movie.title }}</span>\n          <span class=\"field\" data-testid=\"summary-item-datetime\">{{ loaded.screening.date }} {{ loaded.screening.time }}</span>\n          <span class=\"field\" data-testid=\"summary-item-row\">{{ line.item.row }}</span>\n          <span class=\"field\" data-testid=\"summary-item-seat\">{{ line.seat }}</span>\n          <span class=\"field\" data-testid=\"summary-item-price\">{{ line.price }}</span>\n          <button\n            type=\"button\"\n            matButton\n            data-testid=\"summary-item-remove-button\"\n            (click)=\"remove(line.key)\"\n          >Remove</button>\n        </li>\n      }\n    </ul>\n\n    <p class=\"total\" data-testid=\"summary-total\">{{ total() }}</p>\n\n    <div class=\"actions\">\n      <button type=\"button\" matButton=\"outlined\" data-testid=\"back-button\" (click)=\"back()\">Back</button>\n      <button type=\"button\" matButton=\"filled\" data-testid=\"confirm-button\" (click)=\"confirm()\">Confirm</button>\n    </div>\n  }\n</section>\n==== summary/summary.scss\n:host {\n  display: block;\n}\n\n.summary {\n  max-width: 720px;\n  margin: 0 auto;\n  padding: 24px;\n\n  h1 {\n    margin: 0 0 16px;\n    font-size: 1.75rem;\n  }\n}\n\n.summary-list {\n  margin: 0;\n  padding: 0;\n  list-style: none;\n}\n\n.summary-item {\n  display: flex;\n  align-items: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n  padding: 12px 0;\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #e0e0e0;\n}\n\n.field {\n  flex: 1;\n}\n\n.summary-item [data-testid='summary-item-title'] {\n  flex: 2;\n  font-weight: 600;\n}\n\n.total {\n  margin: 16px 0 0;\n  font-size: 1.25rem;\n  font-weight: 600;\n  text-align: right;\n}\n\n.actions {\n  display: flex;\n  justify-content: center;\n  gap: 16px;\n  margin-top: 24px;\n}\napp.config.ts\napp.html\napp.routes.ts\napp.scss\napp.spec.ts\napp.ts\nbooking.ts\ncinema-api.ts\ndates.ts\nmodels.ts\nmovie-list\nseat-selection\nsummary\ntoast.ts\n# 04: Booking and summary\n\n**What to build:** The selection becomes a booking kept in `sessionStorage`. `Continue` takes the customer to the summary (`Your tickets`), which lists each ticket with its price, a `Remove` button and the total; `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact and `Cancel` on the seat map clears the booking. The summary and checkout routes redirect to `/` without a matching booking.\n\n**Specification:** sections 3.1, 5.4, 5.6, 6, 9.3, 9.7.\n\n**Blocked by:** 03 — Seat selection, legend and selected-seats panel.\n\n**Status:** done\n\n- [x] AC-28 — Seats in rows 1–5 cost `25.00 PLN`.\n- [x] AC-29 — Seats in rows 6–10 cost `32.00 PLN`.\n- [x] AC-30 — Seats in rows 11–14 cost `39.00 PLN`.\n- [x] AC-31 — A couch costs `89.00 PLN` per couch, not per seat.\n- [x] AC-32 — Accessible seats cost `25.00 PLN`, like the rest of row 1.\n- [x] AC-33 — `Cancel` navigates to `/` and clears the selection.\n- [x] AC-34 — `Continue` navigates to `/screenings/:id/summary`.\n- [x] AC-35 — `Continue` does nothing when no seat is selected.\n- [x] AC-36 — Each selected item is listed with movie title, screening date, time, row number, seat description and price.\n- [x] AC-37 — A couch is described as `Couch <a>-<b>`; a single seat is described by its column number.\n- [x] AC-38 — The total line reads `Total: <sum> PLN` and equals the sum of the listed prices.\n- [x] AC-39 — `Back` returns to the seat map with the selection intact.\n- [x] AC-40 — `Confirm` navigates to `/screenings/:id/checkout`.\n- [x] AC-59 — The summary shows the title `Your tickets`.\n- [x] AC-60 — Each summary item has a `Remove` button that removes it from the booking and updates the total; removing the last item returns to the seat map.\n- [x] AC-67 — Every summary identifier in section 9.3 is present with the exact names and values given there.\n- [x] The booking survives a reload of the seat map and of the summary.","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01BkLP1LQtz921G1oMMPTki4","session_id":"f36d358a-b9a0-405d-bd0d-b9be109acf26","uuid":"d3f5a946-c722-43a7-8502-6af881c8654a","timestamp":"2026-11-27T14:03:17.010Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 05"}
