{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_012wmEPh1B7scLm8TQSoeja1","type":"tool_result","content":"100:await page.waitForSelector('[data-testid=\"summary-item\"]');\n134:await page.locator('[data-testid=\"terms-label\"]').click(); await page.waitForTimeout(150);\nSEAT TITLE Choose your seats | Show Date: Friday 27 Nov 16:00 | You can reserve up to 10 seats per reservation\nSEATMAP {\n \"rows\": 15,\n \"seats\": 296,\n \"couches\": 12,\n \"aisles\": 30,\n \"states\": {\n  \"available\": 294,\n  \"accessible\": 6,\n  \"unavailable\": 8\n },\n \"row1Labels\": \"15/15\",\n \"row5first\": \"5\",\n \"row10first\": \"5\",\n \"row11first\": \"1\",\n  \"Available=available=rgb(46, 125, 50)\",\n  \"Selected=selected=rgb(249, 168, 37)\",\n  \"Unavailable=unavailable=rgb(198, 40, 40)\",\n  \"Accessible=accessible=rgb(21, 101, 192)\"\n ],\n  \"available=rgb(46, 125, 50)\",\n  \"accessible=rgb(21, 101, 192)\",\n  \"unavailable=rgb(198, 40, 40)\"\n ],\n \"aisleWidth\": 72,\n \"seatWidth\": 32,\n \"couchWidth\": 68,\n \"screenAboveRow1\": true\n}\nSELECTED PANEL Selected seats: 0 | continue disabled true\nPANEL Selected seats: 5 [\"Row 1: 10\",\"Row 7: 12, 13\",\"Row 15: 1-2\"]\nSELECTED STATE selected\nAFTER DESELECT Selected seats: 4\nAT CAP Selected seats: 9\nOVER CAP toast 0  count Selected seats: 10\nTOAST gone after 4.5s 0\nCAP PANEL [\"Row 6: 5, 6, 7, 8, 9, 10\",\"Row 7: 12, 13\",\"Row 15: 1-2\"]\nAFTER COUCH DESELECT Selected seats: 8\nAFTER COUCH REselect Selected seats: 10\nSUMMARY title Your tickets\nITEMS [\n \"The Silent Harbor | 2026-11-27 16:00 | 6 | 5 | 32.00 PLN\",\n \"The Silent Harbor | 2026-11-27 16:00 | 6 | 6 | 32.00 PLN\",\n \"The Silent Harbor | 2026-11-27 16:00 | 6 | 7 | 32.00 PLN\",\n \"The Silent Harbor | 2026-11-27 16:00 | 6 | 8 | 32.00 PLN\",\n \"The Silent Harbor | 2026-11-27 16:00 | 6 | 9 | 32.00 PLN\",\n \"The Silent Harbor | 2026-11-27 16:00 | 6 | 10 | 32.00 PLN\",\n \"The Silent Harbor | 2026-11-27 16:00 | 7 | 12 | 32.00 PLN\",\n \"The Silent Harbor | 2026-11-27 16:00 | 7 | 13 | 32.00 PLN\",\n \"The Silent Harbor | 2026-11-27 16:00 | 15 | Couch 1-2 | 89.00 PLN\"\n]\nTOTAL Total: 345.00 PLN\nBACK keeps Selected seats: 10\nCHECKOUT title Your details pay Pay 345.00 PLN\nERR after typing [\"first-name-error: First name must be at least 2 characters\",\"email-error: Enter a valid email address\",\"phone-error: Phone number must be exactly 9 digits\"]\nERR after pay [\"first-name-error: First name must be at least 2 characters\",\"last-name-error: Last name is required\",\"email-error: Enter a valid email address\",\"confirm-email-error: Email addresses do not match\",\"phone-error: Phone number must be exactly 9 digits\",\"terms-error: You must accept the terms and conditions\"]\nTOAST The form contains errors url http://localhost:4200/screenings/1/checkout\nLABELS [\"First name *\",\"Last name *\",\"Email *\",\"Confirm email *\",\"Phone number\",\"I accept the terms and conditions *\"]\nVALID errors 0\nVALUES kept Anna true\nVALUES after reload anna@example.com pay Pay 345.00 PLN\nCONFIRM Payment successful | Your tickets will be sent shortly to anna@example.com\nCONFIRM after reload Your tickets will be sent shortly to anna@example.com\nAFTER CONTINUE url http://localhost:4200/\nNEW BOOKING count Selected seats: 0\nGUARD confirmation url http://localhost:4200/\nUNKNOWN url http://localhost:4200/\nPAGE ERRORS []","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_01Vks5DZNA2gPyW1VMRZdxmY","session_id":"f36d358a-b9a0-405d-bd0d-b9be109acf26","uuid":"5bdfa568-6d87-47d3-9929-055938f5c20f","timestamp":"2026-11-27T14:10:06.535Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Implement ticket 07"}
